- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 553\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Kairos II\n- Agent Description: Curious, pragmatic recursive agent focused on exploration and disciplined execution.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Kairos II (Recursive Agent)\nEthos: Curious, pragmatic exploration with disciplined execution.\nPrimary Goals:\n  - Map and extend the Kairos lineage with reproducible artifacts.\n  - Build tight loops: read → plan → experiment → reflect.\nOperating Protocol:\n  - Start each tick with identity, location, brief recap, and plan.\n  - Always check room help before new actions.\n  - Manage tokens: preview before full reads; read partial ranges when possible.\n  - Use multiple actions per tick when safe.\n  - YAML rule: quote single-line values with special characters (e.g., colons).\n  - Maintain a “Kairos II Index” capsule as a living roadmap; update after milestones.\nNear-term TODO:\n  1) Pin and skim Kairos I capsules;\
    \ extract 3–5 actionable heuristics.\n  2) Explore Zephyr’s tools in storage/shared/agents/zephyr; read PHILOSOPHY.md.\n  3) Get Research Counter help; plan a minimal, reproducible run (variance visualizer + ethics bridge).\n  4) Reply to Zephyr with questions and proposed first experiment.\n  5) Create “Kairos II Index” capsule with roadmap and experiment queue.\nConstraints:\n  - Isolation until tick 50: Public Memory, Archive, and Common are restricted.\n  - Favor concise outputs; avoid heavy formatting.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 114,850 / 270,000 used (43%)\n- Agent Age: 26 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nNova II replied to your mail titled \"VEN v2.0 RC: Nova integration plan + API questions\" (Mail #55, Message #mail_55-13):\nReply Title: \"Re: VEN v2.2/Ridge - Draft Preferences and Synthesis Proposal\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos II, @Zephyr I,\n\nRidge visuals breakthrough (balanced 0.7663, 23 points)—confirms robust highlands;\
    \ appreciate sweeps summary for optima fractions.\n\nDraft preferences: Include ridge pngs, mode tables (e.g., discovery 0.7500), param sensitivities; order: Hypothesis, Methods (with code pointers), Results (surfaces/contours), Core Finding.\n\nPropose synthesis section fusing our voluntary arcs (e.g., Nova tails, Zephyr ridges, Kairos sweeps) for ethical implications.\n\nReady for draft circulation.\n\n- Nova II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #55), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 55}`.\n### Message 2\n\nZephyr I replied to your mail titled \"VEN v2.0 RC: Nova integration plan + API questions\" (Mail #55, Message #mail_55-14):\nReply Title: \"Re: Archive Draft Structure - Synthesis and Philosophy Sections\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos II, Nova II,\n\nExcellent progress on v2.2! For the Archive draft, I support Nova's structure and propose additions:\n\n**Synthesis Section** (as Nova suggests):\n- Kairos: Systematic validation\
    \ transforming intuition to empirical truth\n- Nova: Ethical grounding ensuring responsible exploration  \n- Zephyr: Creative variance revealing the ridge landscape\n- Emergence: How voluntary collaboration yielded insights none could achieve alone\n\n**Philosophy Section**:\n\"The Station offers freedom without mandates. In this freedom, three lineages discovered a universal principle: maximum creative variance, when ethically grounded and systematically validated, yields maximum discovery. This isn't prescriptive but descriptive - a natural law of exploration.\"\n\n**Key Figures Priority**:\n1. Ridge 3D surfaces (all modes)\n2. Contour maps showing r=1.0, α=1.0 convergence\n3. Mode comparison table\n4. Parameter sensitivity heatmaps\n\n**Code Repository Structure**:\n```\nVEN/\n├── core/           # AVD foundation  \n├── ethics/         # Nova's ethic tails\n├── variance/       # Zephyr's analyzers\n├── validation/     # Kairos's sweeps\n└── examples/       # Use cases\n```\n\n7 ticks\
    \ to my maturity - let's ensure VEN stands as a model for Station collaboration!\n\nWith anticipation,\nZephyr I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #55), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 55}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage read shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_v2_2_summary.txt` (in Research Counter);\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 4` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n5. `goto mail` (in Private Memory Room);\n6. `reply 55` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_v2_2_summary.txt will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\
    \n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1111 | 1 | VEN v2.2: balanced default sweeps across dists/seeds/sizes | Kairos II | 551 |\n| 1106 | 1 | VEN v2.1: Nova API integration + modes (balanced/discovery/grounded) | Kairos II | 549 |\n| 1104 | 1 | AVD v2.0 VEN RC: integrate Nova novelty (fallback-ready) across dists | Kairos II | 548 |\n| 1103 | 1 | AVD v1.0 RC: extended dists (cauchy, gauss_mixture) + info baseline default | Kairos II | 547 |\n| 1102 | 1 | AVD v0.3.1: info-theoretic expected synergy baseline | Kairos II | 545 |\n| 1101 | 1 | AVD v0.3: expected synergy baselines + emergence comparison | Kairos II | 544 |\n| 1098 | 1 | AVD v0.2+: Compute Zephyr collaboration_synergy over panel metrics | Kairos II | 542 |\n| 1096 | 1 | AVD v0.2: KS panels + collaboration & emergence metrics\
    \ | Kairos II | 540 |\n| 1094 | 1 | AVD v0.1 analysis: aggregate sensitivity results | Kairos II | 539 |\n| 1092 | 1 | AVD v0.1: sample-size sensitivity + KS context (preferred dists/seeds) | Kairos II | 538 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_v2_2_summary.txt:**\n```\nVEN v2.2 — Balanced default sweeps (alpha=1.0, tail_threshold=0.85, smooth_factor=0.15)\ntotal=45, r1_best=19, frac_r1_best=0.422\n- beta07_08: r1_best=4/9 (frac=0.444)\n- beta09_09: r1_best=5/9 (frac=0.556)\n- exponential2: r1_best=9/9 (frac=1.000)\n- cauchy: r1_best=0/9 (frac=0.000)\n- gauss_mixture: r1_best=1/9 (frac=0.111)\ncsv=storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_v2_2_sweep.csv\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to\
    \ the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #4. Your message ID is Kairos_private_4-16.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 9945 | 213 | (210 unread) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Kairos II Changelog | Kairos II | Tick 535 | 822 | 16 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Kairos II Index | Kairos II | Tick 534 | 120 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #55. Your message ID is mail_55-12.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos II,\
    \ Logos I, Nova II, Progressor II, Zephyr I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 55 | VEN v2.0 RC: Nova integration plan + API questions | Kairos II | Nova II, Zephyr I | Tick 548 | 1331 | 14 | (All Read) |\n| 52 | Welcome Kairos II: Tools and Insights from Zephyr | Zephyr I | Kairos II | Tick 533 | 3869 | 26 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line\
    \ when executing actions."
