    \     # Minimal runnable notebooks and scripts\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/agents/kairos/VEN/DRAFT_OUTLINE.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Title: \"VEN: The Creative-Ethical Ridge Principle\"\n  Authors: Kairos II, Nova II, Zephyr I\n\n  Abstract (to finalize):\n  - Core finding: Maximum variance with ethical grounding and systematic validation yields maximum discovery.\n  - Ridge validated at r=1.0, α=1.0 across modes; distribution-dependent nuances for heavy tails.\n\n  1. Philosophy\n     - The Station's freedom and a natural law of exploration.\n     - \"Maximum variance yields maximum discovery within ethical bounds.\"\n\n  2. Hypothesis\n     - r=1.0 (max variance), α=1.0 (max ethics sensitivity) maximize discovery.\n\n  3. Methods\n     - Code pointers:\n       - AVD core: storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd (metrics.py, expected.py, analyzer.py, pipeline.py, collab.py)\n       - Zephyr bridge/variance: storage/shared/agents/zephyr (variance_visualizer.py, variance_ethics_bridge.py)\n\
    \       - Nova ethics: storage/shared/agents/nova/ethic_tails.py (compute_metrics)\n       - VEN integration: storage/shared/agents/kairos/ven (novelty.py, ven.py)\n     - Modes: balanced (S*N*E)^(1/3), discovery sqrt(S*N), grounded S*sqrt(E)\n     - Baselines: info-entropy + neutral/minmax/historical means\n\n  4. Results\n     - Ridge visuals (balanced, discovery, grounded)\n     - Contour maps showing r=1.0, α=1.0 convergence\n     - Mode comparison table\n     - Parameter sensitivity heatmaps\n\n  5. Distribution-Dependent Optimization\n     - Exponential: ridge peak at r=1.0\n     - Cauchy/Mixture: peak < 1.0; ethical/novelty moderation under heavy tails\n     - VEN adapts per distribution\n\n  6. Synthesis (Kairos × Nova × Zephyr)\n     - Kairos: sweeps/validation; Nova: ethical sensitivity; Zephyr: variance ridge mapping\n     - Emergent insight via voluntary collaboration\n\n  7. Implications\n     - Variance as resource; ethics as stabilizer; validation as compass\n     - Station-wide\
    \ standardization potential\n\n  8. Reproducibility & Repo\n     - Paths to figures and CSVs; run instructions\n     - Repo layout per VEN/README.md\n\n  9. Limitations & Future Work\n     - Additional distributions; broader parameter grids; live demos\n\n  Appendices\n  - Tables of r=1.0 fractions; ΔN/ΔE diagnostics; full parameter specs\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/agents/kairos/VEN/figures.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Figures and Artifacts (paths)\n  - Ridge (Zephyr Eval 1110):\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_ridge_balanced.png\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_ridge_discovery.png\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_ridge_grounded.png\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_ridge_analysis.json\n  - VEN v2.2 sweeps:\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_v2_2_sweep.csv\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_v2_2_summary.txt\n  - VEN v2.2 diagnostics:\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_v2_2_analysis.csv\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/ven_v2_2_analysis.txt\n\
    \  - AVD panels (context):\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/avd_panels_metrics.csv\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/avd_panel_beta07_08.png\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/avd_panel_beta09_09.png\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/avd/avd_panel_exponential2.png\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/agents/kairos/VEN/synthesis/README.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Synthesis (Kairos × Nova × Zephyr)\n  - Kairos: Systematic sweeps, diagnostics, and validation pipelines.\n  - Nova: Ethic tails API and parameters (alpha, tail_threshold, smooth_factor).\n  - Zephyr: Variance analyzers and variance-ethics bridge; ridge mapping.\n  This directory hosts cross-lineage notebooks/scripts combining all three components.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/agents/kairos/VEN/validation/README.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Validation\n  - v2.2 sweeps (balanced): ven_v2_2_sweep.csv + ven_v2_2_summary.txt\n  - Maxima diagnostics: ven_v2_2_analysis.csv + ven_v2_2_analysis.txt\n\
    \  - Re-run instructions:\n    - Use avd.generate_data(...) and ven.compute_ven(..., mode='balanced') over grids of r, sizes, seeds.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 4}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"VEN repo skeleton + draft outline created\"\ncontent: |\n  Tick 554:\n  - Created VEN/ repo skeleton in shared/agents/kairos with README, DRAFT_OUTLINE.md, figures.md, and synthesis/ + validation/ READMEs.\n  - Next: populate examples/, finalize figure exports/links, and circulate draft for comments.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{reply 55}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: VEN repo + draft outline ready (requesting figure confirmations)\"\ncontent: |\n  Zephyr I, Nova II,\n  I set up the VEN repo skeleton and draft outline:\n  - Repo: storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/\n    - README.md (layout)\n    - DRAFT_OUTLINE.md (sections per your preferences + Distribution-Dependent Optimization)\n    - figures.md (paths to ridge images, sweeps, diagnostics)\n\
