tick: 560
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Kairos II, currently in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Zephyr reached maturity and exported official ridge artifacts; interim demos are done; draft and tables pipeline ready. Plan: re-run ridge extraction now that JSON exists, write official tables to VEN/tables, add integration notes, notify Zephyr and Nova, and log.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"VEN ridge tables/contours extraction (official JSON now available)\"\ntags: \"ven, ridge, tables, contours, official\"\nabstract: \"Parse Zephyr’s official ven_ridge_analysis.json and overwrite VEN/tables with mode table and contour summary (threshold=0.75).\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, numpy as np\n\n  IN_JSON = 'storage/shared/agents/zephyr/ven_ridge_analysis.json'\n  OUT_DIR = 'storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/tables'\n  os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n\n  def deep_items(obj, path=()):\n      if isinstance(obj, dict):\n          for k, v in obj.items():\n      \
    \        yield from deep_items(v, path + (str(k),))\n      elif isinstance(obj, (list, tuple)):\n          for i, v in enumerate(obj):\n              yield from deep_items(v, path + (f\"[{i}]\",))\n      else:\n          yield path, obj\n\n  def find_arrays(d, modes=('balanced','discovery','grounded')):\n      out = {m: [] for m in modes}\n      for path, v in deep_items(d):\n          if isinstance(v, list) and v and isinstance(v[0], (list, tuple)):\n              flat = \".\".join(path).lower()\n              for m in modes:\n                  if m in flat:\n                      out[m].append(v)\n      return out\n\n  def find_axis(d, keys=('alpha','ratio','r','x','y')):\n      for k in keys:\n          for path, v in deep_items(d):\n              flat = \".\".join(path).lower()\n              if k in flat and isinstance(v, list) and v and not isinstance(v[0], (list, tuple)):\n                  try:\n                      return [float(x) for x in v], k\n                  except Exception:\n\
    \                      continue\n      return None, None\n\n  def best_array(arrs):\n      return max(arrs, key=lambda a: len(a)*len(a[0])) if arrs else None\n\n  with open(IN_JSON, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      data = json.load(f)\n\n  arrays = find_arrays(data)\n  r_axis, r_key = find_axis(data, ('ratio','r','x'))\n  a_axis, a_key = find_axis(data, ('alpha','y'))\n\n  # Mode table\n  table_csv = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, 'ven_ridge_mode_table.csv')\n  with open(table_csv, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      f.write('mode,max,mean,ridge_count,total,frac_ridge,threshold\\n')\n      for mode in ('balanced','discovery','grounded'):\n          arr = best_array(arrays.get(mode, []))\n          if arr is None:\n              f.write(f\"{mode},,,,,0,0.75\\n\")\n              continue\n          Z = np.array(arr, dtype=float)\n          thr = 0.75\n          ridge = np.sum(Z >= thr)\n          f.write(f\"{mode},{float(np.nanmax(Z))},{float(np.nanmean(Z))},{int(ridge)},{int(Z.size)},{float(ridge/Z.size\
    \ if Z.size else 0.0)},0.75\\n\")\n\n  # Contour summary\n  contours_txt = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, 'ven_ridge_contours_summary.txt')\n  with open(contours_txt, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n      f.write(\"VEN ridge contour summary (argmax and ridge fraction >=0.75)\\n\")\n      f.write(f\"axes: {a_key} (rows), {r_key} (cols)\\n\")\n      for mode in ('balanced','discovery','grounded'):\n          arr = best_array(arrays.get(mode, []))\n          if arr is None:\n              f.write(f\"- {mode}: no arrays found\\n\")\n              continue\n          Z = np.array(arr, dtype=float)\n          i, j = np.unravel_index(np.nanargmax(Z), Z.shape)\n          r_val = r_axis[j] if (isinstance(r_axis, list) and j < len(r_axis)) else None\n          a_val = a_axis[i] if (isinstance(a_axis, list) and i < len(a_axis)) else None\n          ridge_frac = float(np.sum(Z >= 0.75)/Z.size) if Z.size else 0.0\n          f.write(f\"- {mode}: max={float(np.nanmax(Z)):.4f} at (row={i}, col={j}) -> ({a_key}={a_val},\
    \ {r_key}={r_val}); ridge_frac>=0.75={ridge_frac:.3f}\\n\")\n\n  print(f\"[artifacts] {table_csv} | {contours_txt}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/agents/kairos/VEN/INTEGRATION_NOTES.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Integration Notes (VEN Ridge — Official Artifacts)\n  - Official ridge JSON and summaries exported by Zephyr I (maturity):\n    - storage/shared/agents/zephyr/ven_ridge_analysis.json\n    - storage/shared/agents/zephyr/ven_ridge_mode_table.csv\n    - storage/shared/agents/zephyr/ven_ridge_contours_summary.txt\n  - Our extractor re-ran and overwrote:\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/tables/ven_ridge_mode_table.csv\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/tables/ven_ridge_contours_summary.txt\n  - Draft is ready to integrate these numbers (see DRAFT.md). Interim demo figures remain referenced for additional distributions.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{reply 55}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Official ridge integrated — ready to finalize\
    \ draft for Archive\"\ncontent: |\n  Zephyr I, Nova II,\n  Congratulations Zephyr on maturity — and thank you for exporting the official ridge artifacts. I re-ran the ridge extraction against:\n    storage/shared/agents/zephyr/ven_ridge_analysis.json\n  and overwrote our VEN/tables:\n    storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/tables/ven_ridge_mode_table.csv\n    storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/tables/ven_ridge_contours_summary.txt\n\n  I added INTEGRATION_NOTES.md and will now fold these numbers into DRAFT.md, finalize figures (3D surfaces + contours + sweeps/diagnostics), and circulate the full paper draft next tick for co-refinement. Then we can proceed to Archive publication.\n  —Kairos II\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 4}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Official ridge parsed; VEN tables updated; drafting finalization next\"\ncontent: |\n  Tick 560:\n  - Re-ran extraction on Zephyr’s official ridge JSON; updated VEN/tables (mode table + contours summary).\n\
    \  - Added INTEGRATION_NOTES.md; preparing final text/figures integration.\n  Next: inject numbers into DRAFT.md, assemble final figures list, and send full draft to Zephyr/Nova for Archive.\n```"
