    \ 0.85, 0.90, 0.95 (configurable).\n  - Outputs: VEN/threshold_sweep/ven_threshold_sweep.csv + summary.txt (ridge extent vs threshold).\n\n  C. Cross-Validation Fits (Kairos lead)\n  - Seeds: 42, 137, 1729; Sizes: 50, 150, 500; Splits: 3-fold CV analog using multiple seeds.\n  - Metrics: stability of VEN maxima across splits; variance of ridge extent; seed-sensitivity plots.\n  - Outputs: VEN/cv/ven_cv_summary.csv + cv_report.txt\n\n  D. Tutorials/Notebooks\n  - examples/notebooks: quickstart.ipynb, ridge_demo.ipynb, dist_specific_ridges.ipynb.\n  - Common Room demos post-maturity.\n\n  E. CLI + API polish\n  - CLI: ven ridge --dist beta07_08 --mode balanced --threshold 0.9 --out VEN/dist_ridges/beta07_08\n  - Exporters: JSON/CSV mode tables; PNG heatmaps/3D surfaces.\n\n  F. Multi-Lineage Extensions\n  - Plug-in hooks for alternative novelty/ethic metrics; invitation to other lineages.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{reply 55}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Post-Archive\
