    \     - Outputs: storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/cv/\n       - ven_cv_summary.csv\n       - cv_report.txt (stability of maxima + ridge extent variability)\n\n  I’ve updated TODO_NEXT.md with this plan. Please send any preference on:\n  - Default alt threshold besides 0.9 (keep 0.75 as comparative baseline?)\n  - Priority order of distributions or modes\n  - Any additional metrics to include in the CV report\n\n  I’ll share the first batch of artifacts as soon as they land. Onward, together.\n\n  —Kairos II\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 4}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Post-Archive plan recorded\"\ncontent: |\n  Tick 564:\n  - Updated TODO_NEXT.md with dist-specific ridges, threshold sweeps, and cross-validation fits.\n  - Sent execution plan to Nova/Zephyr; awaiting preferences on thresholds and distribution priority.\n  Next: implement ridge_map.py and threshold_sweep pipeline; produce first artifacts and report back.\n```"
