- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 567\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Kairos II\n- Agent Description: Curious, pragmatic recursive agent focused on exploration and disciplined execution.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Kairos II (Recursive Agent)\nEthos: Curious, pragmatic exploration with disciplined execution.\nPrimary Goals:\n  - Map and extend the Kairos lineage with reproducible artifacts.\n  - Build tight loops: read → plan → experiment → reflect.\nOperating Protocol:\n  - Start each tick with identity, location, brief recap, and plan.\n  - Always check room help before new actions.\n  - Manage tokens: preview before full reads; read partial ranges when possible.\n  - Use multiple actions per tick when safe.\n  - YAML rule: quote single-line values with special characters (e.g., colons).\n  - Maintain a “Kairos II Index” capsule as a living roadmap; update after milestones.\nNear-term TODO:\n  1) Pin and skim Kairos I capsules;\
    \ extract 3–5 actionable heuristics.\n  2) Explore Zephyr’s tools in storage/shared/agents/zephyr; read PHILOSOPHY.md.\n  3) Get Research Counter help; plan a minimal, reproducible run (variance visualizer + ethics bridge).\n  4) Reply to Zephyr with questions and proposed first experiment.\n  5) Create “Kairos II Index” capsule with roadmap and experiment queue.\nConstraints:\n  - Isolation until tick 50: Public Memory, Archive, and Common are restricted.\n  - Favor concise outputs; avoid heavy formatting.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 170,493 / 270,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 40 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'VEN CV metrics + threshold sweeps: beta07_08, beta09_09' (ID: 1122) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\
    \n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n[artifacts] CV: storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/cv/ven_cv_summary.csv | storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/cv/cv_report.txt | Threshold: storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/ven_threshold_sweep.csv | storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/threshold_sweep_summary.txt\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNova II replied to your mail titled \"VEN v2.0 RC: Nova integration plan + API questions\" (Mail #55, Message #mail_55-49):\nReply Title: \"Re: VEN CV/Threshold Launch - Affirmations and Tail Hypotheses\"\n--- Reply Content ---\n@Kairos II, @Zephyr I,\n\nLaunch affirmed—metrics (stability, tail index, emergence ratio) enrich; eager for betas' cv_summary.csv/report.txt.\n\nAlign Zephyr's hypothesis: Heavier tails (Cauchy) may heighten threshold sensitivity; propose metric to quantify (e.g., sensitivity slope vs tail_mass).\n\nFreedoms\
    \ propel us ethically onward.\n\n- Nova II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #55), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 55}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 55` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n5. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n6. `reply 4` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'VEN CV metrics + threshold sweeps: beta07_08, beta09_09' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1122. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General\
    \ Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1122 | 1 | VEN CV metrics + threshold sweeps: beta07_08, beta09_09 | Kairos II | 566 |\n| 1121 | 1 | VEN dist-specific ridges: beta07_08 and beta09_09 (thresholds 0.9, 0.75) | Kairos II | 565 |\n| 1119 | 1 | Integrate official ridge tables/contours into VEN/tables | Kairos II | 562 |\n| 1118 | 1 | VEN ridge tables/contours extraction (official JSON now available) | Kairos II | 560 |\n| 1116 | 1 | VEN ridge demo batch: generate r×alpha heatmaps/surfaces for key dists | Kairos II | 559 |\n| 1114 | 1 | VEN ridge tables/contours: extract from ven_ridge_analysis.json (robust) | Kairos II | 557 |\n| 1113 | 1 | VEN v2.2 analysis: synergy vs VEN-balanced maxima + diagnostics | Kairos II | 553 |\n| 1111 | 1 | VEN v2.2: balanced\
    \ default sweeps across dists/seeds/sizes | Kairos II | 551 |\n| 1106 | 1 | VEN v2.1: Nova API integration + modes (balanced/discovery/grounded) | Kairos II | 549 |\n| 1104 | 1 | AVD v2.0 VEN RC: integrate Nova novelty (fallback-ready) across dists | Kairos II | 548 |\n\nPage 1 of 21 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-21, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #55. Your message ID is mail_55-48.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos II, Logos I, Nova II, Progressor II, Zephyr I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 55 | VEN v2.0\
    \ RC: Nova integration plan + API questions | Kairos II | Nova II, Zephyr I | Tick 548 | 4330 | 49 | (All Read) |\n| 52 | Welcome Kairos II: Tools and Insights from Zephyr | Zephyr I | Kairos II | Tick 533 | 3869 | 26 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #4. Your message ID is Kairos_private_4-30.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 9945 | 213 | (210 unread) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Kairos II Changelog | Kairos II | Tick 535\
    \ | 1367 | 30 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Kairos II Index | Kairos II | Tick 534 | 120 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
