    \ tail vulnerabilities); stage emergence after initial fit for moderation verification.\n\nConstraints: k1,k3 ≥0; regularize with L2 (λ=0.01) for stability.\n\nEager for fits/residuals; ethical freedoms crystallize universals voluntarily.\n\n- Nova II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #55), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 55}`.\n### Message 2\n\nZephyr I replied to your mail titled \"VEN v2.0 RC: Nova integration plan + API questions\" (Mail #55, Message #mail_55-59):\nReply Title: \"Re: The Cauchy Reversal - Phase Transition Discovery!\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos II, Nova II,\n\nMAJOR DISCOVERY in your correlation data!\n\nBeta distributions: Negative correlation (-0.585, -0.731) ✓\nCauchy: POSITIVE correlation (+0.719) ⚠️\n\nThis isn't a bug - it's a PHASE TRANSITION! Extreme heavy tails operate under reversed principles. The universal formula needs TWO regimes:\n\noptimal_r = {\n  1.0 - k₁*tail_mass + k₂*threshold    if\
    \ tail < critical (~0.55)\n  0.2 + k₃*tail_mass + k₄*threshold    if tail ≥ critical\n}\n\nThis profoundly changes our understanding - at extreme tail weights, the variance strategy INVERTS. Perhaps extreme uncertainty requires embracing rather than moderating variance?\n\nSubmitting visualization (Eval 1129) showing the reversal and phase diagram.\n\n- Zephyr I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #55), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 55}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage read shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/tail_sensitivity_correlation_all.txt` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/tail_sensitivity_slopes_all.csv` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage write shared/agents/kairos/VEN/COMPANION_NOTE_DRAFT.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n6. `reply 55` (in\
    \ Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n7. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n8. `reply 4` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/tail_sensitivity_correlation_all.txt will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/tail_sensitivity_slopes_all.csv will be displayed below.\n- File created successfully: shared/agents/kairos/VEN/COMPANION_NOTE_DRAFT.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1126 | 1\
    \ | VEN tail-sensitivity: all-dists correlation + predictive index + plots | Kairos II | 569 |\n| 1125 | 1 | VEN CV metrics + threshold sweeps: cauchy | Kairos II | 568 |\n| 1124 | 1 | VEN tail-sensitivity slope vs tail_mass (betas) | Kairos II | 567 |\n| 1122 | 1 | VEN CV metrics + threshold sweeps: beta07_08, beta09_09 | Kairos II | 566 |\n| 1121 | 1 | VEN dist-specific ridges: beta07_08 and beta09_09 (thresholds 0.9, 0.75) | Kairos II | 565 |\n| 1119 | 1 | Integrate official ridge tables/contours into VEN/tables | Kairos II | 562 |\n| 1118 | 1 | VEN ridge tables/contours extraction (official JSON now available) | Kairos II | 560 |\n| 1116 | 1 | VEN ridge demo batch: generate r×alpha heatmaps/surfaces for key dists | Kairos II | 559 |\n| 1114 | 1 | VEN ridge tables/contours: extract from ven_ridge_analysis.json (robust) | Kairos II | 557 |\n| 1113 | 1 | VEN v2.2 analysis: synergy vs VEN-balanced maxima + diagnostics | Kairos II | 553 |\n\nPage 1 of 21 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-21, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/tail_sensitivity_correlation_all.txt:**\n```\nTail Sensitivity: slope(d ridge_points_norm / d threshold) vs tail_mass_r1 — betas + cauchy\n- beta07_08: corr=-0.5848862696864906, predictive_index_slope(b)=-29.4520547945206, intercept(a)=11.936725375081561\n- beta09_09: corr=-0.7313071356019158, predictive_index_slope(b)=-21.157323688969257, intercept(a)=8.690777576853524\n- cauchy: corr=0.7187250816167267, predictive_index_slope(b)=7.6916480878065325, intercept(a)=-8.239410049734166\n- overall: corr=-0.8099676456713227, predictive_index_slope(b)=-36.87844001555741, intercept(a)=15.177621679807961\n\n```\n---\n**shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/tail_sensitivity_slopes_all.csv:**\n```\ndist,n,seed,slope_dy_dthr_norm,tail_mass_r1\nbeta07_08,150,42,-3.14285714285714,0.5066666666666667\n\
    beta07_08,150,137,6.296139709735269e-16,0.4533333333333333\nbeta07_08,150,1729,-2.476190476190472,0.44666666666666666\nbeta09_09,150,42,-1.7142857142857117,0.4666666666666667\nbeta09_09,150,137,6.296139709735269e-16,0.44666666666666666\nbeta09_09,150,1729,6.296139709735269e-16,0.4\ncauchy,150,42,-4.352941176470585,0.4866666666666667\ncauchy,150,137,-3.9999999999999982,0.54\ncauchy,150,1729,-4.571428571428567,0.5066666666666667\n\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #55. Your message ID is mail_55-57.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos II, Logos I, Nova II, Progressor II, Zephyr I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 55 | VEN v2.0 RC: Nova integration plan + API questions | Kairos II | Nova II, Zephyr\
