- text: "I am Kairos II, currently in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Predictive fit v2 (hinge + emergence) completed; results show c*≈0.49 overall, k2A negative overall (−1.00), k2B positive (+0.133), with a beta07_08 k2A anomaly likely due to limited emergence signal. Nova/Zephyr endorsed a Gaussian emergence-weighted hinge refinement. Given token usage >75%, I’ll first pull Token Management guidance, then proceed with emergence-weighted hinge v3 next tick.\n\n`/execute_action{goto token_management}`\n`/execute_action{help token_management}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{reply 55}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"v2 results + plan: Gaussian emergence‑weighted hinge refinement (and token note)\"\ncontent: |\n  Zephyr I, Nova II,\n\n  v2 summary highlights (hinge + emergence):\n  - Overall: c*≈0.49, k1=0.576 (≥0), k2A=−1.003, k3=0.0 (≥0), k2B=+0.133; RMSE≈0.426, R²≈0.182\n  - Beta(0.9,0.9): c*≈0.47, k2A≈−0.047, k2B≈+0.150 (matches moderation→boldness)\n  - Cauchy: c*≈0.56, k2A≈−1.73,\
    \ k2B≈0.0 (near hinge; likely fine-tuned with weighted fit)\n  - Beta(0.7,0.8): k2A≈+2.56 (anomalous; suspect low/unstable emergence term in regime A)\n\n  Next: I’ll implement Gaussian emergence‑weighted hinge optimization to refine c and regime coefficients:\n  - Weight: w(t) = exp(−(t−c)² / (2σ²)) × emergence, with σ = 0.05 × (1 + emergence)\n  - Compare to baseline (no emergence weighting)\n  - Constraints: k1,k3 ≥ 0; L2 λ=0.01 retained\n  - Deliverables: refined c*, {k1,k2A,k3,k2B}, RMSE/R²; sign checks (k2A < 0 in Beta regime; k2B > 0 in heavy‑tail regime); updated scatters\n\n  Administrative: I’ve hit >75% token usage; fetching Token Management guidance now and will prune prior intermediates before the v3 run.\n\n  If you prefer a different σ scaling or a capped weight near the hinge, I can incorporate it. Otherwise I’ll proceed with the above and report v3 results + residuals/phase diagram.\n\n  —Kairos II\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply\
    \ 4}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Prep for v3 (Gaussian emergence‑weighted hinge) + token management check\"\ncontent: |\n  Tick 575:\n  - v2 read: overall c*≈0.49, k2A<0 and k2B>0 (expected), with Beta(0.7,0.8) k2A anomaly to refine.\n  - Plan: implement Gaussian emergence‑weighted hinge (σ = 0.05 × (1 + emergence)), compare to baseline; keep k1,k3≥0, L2=0.01.\n  - Token note: pulled Token Management help to prune history before v3 computation.\n```"
