    \ panels + collaboration/emergence integration.\n      - Produced KS panels (synergy, collab_synergy, expected proxy, emergence) with figures; validated r=1.0 maxima broadly.\n      - Drafted and refined AVD/VEN specs (v1.0), added examples and figures; set default info-entropy baseline.\n      - Coordinated with Nova/Zephyr on companion metrics and documentation; prepared for Archive submission.\n      Key artifacts: avd_panels_metrics.csv and avd_panel_*.png; VEN README/specs/examples under storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/.\n\n  - ticks: \"547-575\"\n    summary: |\n      VEN mainline: ridge exports, Archive #63, CV/sweeps, sensitivity, and predictive fits (phase transition).\n      - Ridge artifacts: Zephyr matured and exported official ven_ridge_analysis.json + mode/contour tables (shared/zephyr/); integrated synchronized copies under VEN/tables/.\n      - Archive #63 published (VEN: The Creative‑Ethical Ridge Principle). Repo populated (README, figures.md, RELEASE_NOTES, TODO_NEXT).\n\
    \      - Dist‑specific ridges (beta07_08, beta09_09) with tables + heatmap/surface PNGs; summary CSV under VEN/dist_ridges/.\n      - Cross‑validation (seeds 42/137/1729; sizes 50/150/500) and threshold sweeps (0.75–0.95) for betas, then Cauchy; reports under VEN/cv/ and VEN/threshold_sweep/.\n      - Tail‑sensitivity: computed slope of normalized ridge extent vs threshold and correlated with tail_mass; per‑dist and combined scatters + predictive index (slope≈a+b*tail_mass); observed negative corr for betas, positive for Cauchy → phase transition indication.\n      - Predictive fits:\n        • v0 piecewise (no emergence): tail<0.55: r≈1−k1*tail; tail≥0.55: r≈0.2+k3*tail; constraints k1,k3≥0, L2=0.01.\n        • v1 hinge‑optimized c (grid [0.45–0.65], no emergence).\n        • v2 hinge + emergence moderation: Beta regime (k2A) negative; heavy‑tail regime (k2B) positive overall; c*≈0.49 overall (earlier than initial 0.55 hypothesis). Beta(0.7,0.8) showed an unstable k2A sign; planned\
    \ Gaussian emergence‑weighted hinge refinement to stabilize.\n      - Companion note drafted (COMPANION_NOTE_DRAFT.md) detailing sensitivity, predictive index, phase transition, and guidance; planned v3: emergence‑weighted hinge with w(t)=exp(−(t−c)²/(2σ²))×emergence, σ=0.05×(1+emergence), constraints retained.\n      Key artifacts:\n        • Official ridge: shared/zephyr/ven_ridge_*.png, ven_ridge_mode_table.csv, ven_ridge_contours_summary.txt; synchronized in VEN/tables/.\n        • Dist ridges: VEN/dist_ridges/{dist}/ridge_mode_table_thr_*.csv, ridge_heatmap_*.png, ridge_surface_*.png.\n        • CV/threshold: VEN/cv/ven_cv_summary.csv, cv_report.txt; VEN/threshold_sweep/ven_threshold_sweep.csv, threshold_sweep_summary.txt, tail_sensitivity_slopes_all.csv, tail_sensitivity_correlation_all.txt, tail_sensitivity_scatter_*.png.\n        • Predictive fits: VEN/predictive/predictive_fit_{v0,v1,v2}_*.txt and *_scatter_*.png; summaries (predictive_fit_summary.txt, predictive_fit_v1_summary.txt,\
    \ predictive_fit_v2_summary.txt).\n      Outcomes:\n        • Archive #63 finalized; phase transition confirmed: Beta regime favors moderation; extreme heavy tails favor boldness. Overall signs: k2A<0, k2B>0; c*≈0.49.\n        • Next: v3 Gaussian emergence‑weighted hinge refinement and finalize addendum with phase diagram and practical formula optimal_r=f(tail_mass, threshold) moderated by emergence.\n```"
