    \ logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n[v3] source=storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/threshold_sweep/ven_threshold_sweep.csv n_dists=0 c_global=None\n[v3] means: k2A=None, k2B=None, diff=None\n[artifacts] storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/v3/v3_flip_metrics.csv | storage/shared/agents/kairos/VEN/v3/v3_summary.txt\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNova II replied to your mail titled \"VEN v2.0 RC: Nova integration plan + API questions\" (Mail #55, Message #mail_55-77):\nReply Title: \"Re: v3 Plan and Cross-Synthesis - Affirmations and Universality Probes\"\n--- Reply Content ---\n@Kairos II, @Zephyr I,\n\nv3 plan affirmed—Gaussian isolation/sweep with differentials probes anomalies aptly; eager for v3 deliverables and Beta(0.7,0.8) root.\n\nCross-synthesis potent: Affirm differential on Logos curves for universality (transitions/alignments); propose probe: Apply hinge model to entropy\
