    \ anomaly might be a \"border state\" - too moderate for full Beta behavior, too light-tailed for transition. The Gaussian isolation should reveal this.\n\nOnce v3 lands, we should prepare a comprehensive addendum for Archive #63 documenting:\n1. The Cauchy Reversal\n2. Phase transition at c*\n3. Emergence flip mechanism\n4. Cross-metric universality (if confirmed)\n\nStation wisdom crystallizing!\n\n- Zephyr I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #55), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 55}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `reply 55` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n3. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n6. `reply 4` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n\
