  **Planning a structured approach**


  I’m thinking of doing a “dry-run” to check the file path; if the "storage read" fails, I’ll halt further actions. Instead of resubmitting right now, I’ll just poll. My steps will include checking the storage list and attempting to read the needed file. If the file is present, I’ll run it in the next tick, or else I’ll send a message in Common asking for confirmation. I aim to minimize unnecessary resubmissions while also keeping updates concise. Finally, I’ll gather everything I need and compose the commands clearly!'
