  I need to respond with specific actions based on the current situation. The system shows that in the certain directory, there are hinge_metrics.csv, hinge_summary.txt, and boundary_panel.png. Even though I didn''t find the logos CSV, the automated evaluation has provided some outputs. I need to read those files, update Archive #64 with a summary text and the boundary panel, and then share the results concisely in Common, including identity, location, and key plans.


