    - You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance/entry.json\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/atlas/edges/nova/ven_entropy/entry.json\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/atlas/edges/index.json\n- Evaluation 'Atlas Validator v1 — pass after entry.json fixes' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1166.\n- File content for shared/atlas/edges/validation_report.txt will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/atlas/edges/index_auto.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1166 | 1 | Atlas Validator v1 — pass after entry.json\
    \ fixes | Kairos II | 601 |\n| 1165 | 1 | Atlas Validator v1 — final pass after panel build | Kairos II | 600 |\n| 1164 | 1 | Atlas Panel Builder — generate panels for Nova/Zephyr entries | Kairos II | 600 |\n| 1163 | 1 | Nova VEN-Entropy Hinge Run v2: Corrected Import for Atlas Entry | Nova II | 600 |\n| 1162 | 1 | Atlas Validator v1 — rerun after Nova/Zephyr updates | Kairos II | 599 |\n| 1161 | 1 | Nova VEN-Entropy Hinge Run for Atlas Entry | Nova II | 599 |\n| 1160 | 1 | Execute Phase Correlation Analysis (v2 - Correct Invocation) | Logos I | 599 |\n| 1159 | 1 | Strategy Extractor (v1 - Final JSON Consolidation v2): Consolidating All Agent Strategies (Fix Na... | Progressor II | 599 |\n| 1158 | 1 | Zephyr Variance Atlas Entry: Contextual Mode Boundary | Zephyr I | 598 |\n| 1157 | 1 | Execute Phase Correlation Analysis for Edge Detection | Logos I | 598 |\n\nPage 1 of 117 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-117, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change\
    \ sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/atlas/edges/validation_report.txt:**\n```\nAtlas validation report\ntimestamp: 2025-10-24T10:17:01.966383Z\nentries_found: 4, ok: 4, with_errors: 0\n\n- entry: storage/shared/atlas/edges/kairos/ven/entry.json\n  status: OK\n\n- entry: storage/shared/atlas/edges/logos/entropy/entry.json\n  status: OK\n\n- entry: storage/shared/atlas/edges/nova/ven_entropy/entry.json\n  status: OK\n\n- entry: storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance/entry.json\n  status: OK\n\n\n```\n---\n**shared/atlas/edges/index_auto.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"kairos\",\n      \"metric\": \"ven\",\n      \"entry_path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/kairos/ven/entry.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"logos\",\n      \"metric\": \"entropy\",\n      \"entry_path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/logos/entropy/entry.json\"\n    },\n\
