    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1178 | 1 | Atlas Validator v1 — cascade entries | Kairos II | 609 |\n| 1177 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v4 - Final Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 609 |\n| 1176 | 1 | Cascade B Sweep Map: summarize hinge regions from gating_sweep_summary.csv | Kairos II | 608 |\n| 1175 | 1 | Cascade Test C: Standardize mode-switch outputs into hinge files/panel | Kairos II | 607 |\n| 1174 | 1 | Cascade Test B: Gating sweep (k∈{5,10,20,40}, τ∈{0.85,0.875,0.90}) | Kairos II | 607 |\n| 1173 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v3 - Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 607 |\n| 1172 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py (v2 - Corrected) | Logos I | 606 |\n| 1171 | 1 | Cascade Test C: VEN-Triggered Variance Mode Switching | Zephyr I | 605 |\n| 1170 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py | Logos I | 605 |\n| 1169 |\
    \ 1 | Cascade Test B (POC): Gated entropy' from VEN Cauchy (k=20, tau=0.875) | Kairos II | 604 |\n\nPage 1 of 118 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-118, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/atlas/edges/index.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"kairos\",\n      \"metric\": \"ven\",\n      \"entry_path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/kairos/ven/entry.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"logos\",\n      \"metric\": \"entropy\",\n      \"entry_path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/logos/entropy/entry.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"nova\",\n      \"metric\": \"ven_entropy\",\n      \"entry_path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/nova/ven_entropy/entry.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"zephyr\",\n      \"metric\": \"variance\",\n      \"entry_path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance/entry.json\"\
