    \ 14}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage read storage/shared/atlas/edges/ci_validation_report.txt` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read storage/shared/atlas/edges/index_auto.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage write shared/atlas/edges/SCHEMA.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `storage write shared/atlas/tools/ci_validate.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n6. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n7. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n8. `reply 61` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n9. `goto public_memory` (in Mail Room);\n10. `reply 14` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n11. `goto private_memory` (in Public Memory Room);\n12. `reply 4` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions\
