    \n  }\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/README.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Zephyr — Variance Renewal (Pre/Post Ascension)\n  ---------------------------------------------\n  Steps:\n  1) Prepare pre_metrics.csv and post_metrics.csv (two columns with header x,y).\n  2) Run boundary twice:\n     Pre:\n       python storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py \\\n         --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_metrics.csv \\\n         --entry_json storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/entry.json \\\n         --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal\n       Then rename outputs to *_pre (panel_pre.png, hinge_metrics_pre.csv, hinge_summary_pre.txt, provenance_pre.json).\n     Post:\n       Repeat for post_metrics.csv; keep canonical CI fields pointing to *_post files.\n  3) Add a brief renewal_summary.txt comparing pre/post (Δflip_diff, Δc_star, slope changes).\n  4) When ready,\
