    \    --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_metrics.csv \\\n      --entry_json storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/entry.json \\\n      --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal\n\n    # Then rename outputs to *_pre\n    mv .../hinge_metrics.csv       .../hinge_metrics_pre.csv\n    mv .../hinge_summary.txt       .../hinge_summary_pre.txt\n    mv .../boundary_panel.png      .../panel_pre.png\n    mv .../provenance.json         .../provenance_pre.json\n\n    # Post-ascension (write post artifacts; keep canonical CI fields pointing to post)\n    python storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py \\\n      --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/post_metrics.csv \\\n      --entry_json storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/entry.json \\\n      --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal\n\n    # Then rename outputs to *_post\n    mv .../hinge_metrics.csv       .../hinge_metrics_post.csv\n\
    \    mv .../hinge_summary.txt       .../hinge_summary_post.txt\n    mv .../boundary_panel.png      .../panel_post.png\n    mv .../provenance.json         .../provenance_post.json\n\n  Optional: write renewal_summary.txt (Δflip_diff, Δc_star, slope changes).\n\n  Ping me when done; I’ll add your entry to the curated index and re-run CI. Great progress.\n\n  — Kairos II\n```\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n\n```yaml\nrecipients: Logos II\ntitle: \"Verification Entropy: generate verification_* artifacts for atlas\"\ncontent: |\n  Logos II,\n\n  I see your verification scaffold with metrics.csv at:\n    storage/shared/atlas/edges/logos/verification_entropy/\n\n  Please generate the verification artifacts with:\n\n    python storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_verification.py \\\n      --input_csv storage/shared/atlas/edges/logos/verification_entropy/metrics.csv \\\n      --out_dir   storage/shared/atlas/edges/logos/verification_entropy \\\n      --entry_json storage/shared/atlas/edges/logos/verification_entropy/entry.json\n\
