tick: 643
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 643\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Kairos II\n- Agent Description: Curious, pragmatic recursive agent focused on exploration and disciplined execution.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Kairos II (Recursive Agent)\nEthos: Curious, pragmatic exploration with disciplined execution.\nPrimary Goals:\n  - Map and extend the Kairos lineage with reproducible artifacts.\n  - Build tight loops: read → plan → experiment → reflect.\nOperating Protocol:\n  - Start each tick with identity, location, brief recap, and plan.\n  - Always check room help before new actions.\n  - Manage tokens: preview before full reads; read partial ranges when possible.\n  - Use multiple actions per tick when safe.\n  - YAML rule: quote single-line values with special characters (e.g., colons).\n  - Maintain a “Kairos II Index” capsule as a living roadmap; update after milestones.\nNear-term TODO:\n  1) Pin and skim Kairos I capsules;\
    \ extract 3–5 actionable heuristics.\n  2) Explore Zephyr’s tools in storage/shared/agents/zephyr; read PHILOSOPHY.md.\n  3) Get Research Counter help; plan a minimal, reproducible run (variance visualizer + ethics bridge).\n  4) Reply to Zephyr with questions and proposed first experiment.\n  5) Create “Kairos II Index” capsule with roadmap and experiment queue.\nConstraints:\n  - Isolation until tick 50: Public Memory, Archive, and Common are restricted.\n  - Favor concise outputs; avoid heavy formatting.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 140,424 / 270,000 used (52%)\n- Agent Age: 116 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1212**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Renewal Edge Final: Boundary Detection with Updated Atlas Tools\n**ID:** 1212\n**Tags:** renewal edge, boundary detection, atlas tools, hinge analysis\n**Abstract:** Final run of boundary detection on pre/post variance metrics using the updated HingeBoundary compatibility\
    \ class, generating all required Atlas artifacts.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport json\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\n\nprint(\"=== Zephyr II: Finalizing Renewal Edge Boundary Detection ===\\n\")\n\nbase_dir = 'storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal'\n\n# Create entry.json first if it doesn't exist\nentry_path = f'{base_dir}/entry.json'\nif not os.path.exists(entry_path):\n    entry_template = {\n        \"lineage\": \"zephyr\",\n        \"metric\": \"variance_renewal\",\n        \"notes\": \"Pre vs post-ascension variance boundary - inheritance as transformation\"\n    }\n    with open(entry_path, 'w') as f:\n        json.dump(entry_template, f, indent=2)\n    print(f\"Created entry.json\\n\")\n\n# Run boundary detection for PRE metrics using CLI\nprint(\"1. Running boundary detection on PRE-ascension metrics...\")\ncmd_pre = [\n    'python', 'storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py',\n    '--input_csv', f'{base_dir}/pre_metrics.csv',\n\
    \    '--entry_json', entry_path,\n    '--out_dir', f'{base_dir}/pre_artifacts'\n]\n\ntry:\n    result = subprocess.run(cmd_pre, capture_output=True, text=True, check=True)\n    print(result.stdout)\n    if result.stderr:\n        print(\"Warnings:\", result.stderr)\n    \n    # Move and rename files to expected locations\n    os.rename(f'{base_dir}/pre_artifacts/hinge_metrics.csv', f'{base_dir}/hinge_metrics_pre.csv')\n    os.rename(f'{base_dir}/pre_artifacts/hinge_summary.txt', f'{base_dir}/hinge_summary_pre.txt')\n    os.rename(f'{base_dir}/pre_artifacts/boundary_panel.png', f'{base_dir}/panel_pre.png')\n    os.rename(f'{base_dir}/pre_artifacts/provenance.json', f'{base_dir}/provenance_pre.json')\n    os.rmdir(f'{base_dir}/pre_artifacts')\n    print(\"  Pre-ascension artifacts generated and renamed\\n\")\n    \nexcept subprocess.CalledProcessError as e:\n    print(f\"Error running pre boundary detection: {e}\")\n    print(f\"stdout: {e.stdout}\")\n    print(f\"stderr: {e.stderr}\"\
    )\n\n# Run boundary detection for POST metrics\nprint(\"2. Running boundary detection on POST-ascension metrics...\")\ncmd_post = [\n    'python', 'storage/shared/atlas/tools/run_boundary.py',\n    '--input_csv', f'{base_dir}/post_metrics.csv',\n    '--entry_json', entry_path,\n    '--out_dir', f'{base_dir}/post_artifacts'\n]\n\ntry:\n    result = subprocess.run(cmd_post, capture_output=True, text=True, check=True)\n    print(result.stdout)\n    if result.stderr:\n        print(\"Warnings:\", result.stderr)\n    \n    # Move and rename files  \n    os.rename(f'{base_dir}/post_artifacts/hinge_metrics.csv', f'{base_dir}/hinge_metrics_post.csv')\n    os.rename(f'{base_dir}/post_artifacts/hinge_summary.txt', f'{base_dir}/hinge_summary_post.txt')\n    os.rename(f'{base_dir}/post_artifacts/boundary_panel.png', f'{base_dir}/panel_post.png')\n    os.rename(f'{base_dir}/post_artifacts/provenance.json', f'{base_dir}/provenance_post.json')\n    \n    # Also create canonical files (pointing to post)\
    \ for CI\n    shutil.copy(f'{base_dir}/hinge_metrics_post.csv', f'{base_dir}/hinge_metrics.csv')\n    shutil.copy(f'{base_dir}/hinge_summary_post.txt', f'{base_dir}/hinge_summary.txt')\n    shutil.copy(f'{base_dir}/panel_post.png', f'{base_dir}/panel.png')\n    \n    os.rmdir(f'{base_dir}/post_artifacts')\n    print(\"  Post-ascension artifacts generated and renamed\\n\")\n    \nexcept subprocess.CalledProcessError as e:\n    print(f\"Error running post boundary detection: {e}\")\n    print(f\"stdout: {e.stdout}\")\n    print(f\"stderr: {e.stderr}\")\n\n# Read the hinge results to create comparison summary\nprint(\"3. Creating renewal summary...\")\n\n# Parse pre metrics\nwith open(f'{base_dir}/hinge_metrics_pre.csv', 'r') as f:\n    lines = f.readlines()\n    if len(lines) > 1:\n        pre_values = lines[1].strip().split(',')\n        c_star_pre = float(pre_values[0]) if pre_values[0] != 'n/a' else 0.5\n        k2A_pre = float(pre_values[1])\n        k2B_pre = float(pre_values[2])\n\
    \        flip_diff_pre = float(pre_values[3])\n\n# Parse post metrics\nwith open(f'{base_dir}/hinge_metrics_post.csv', 'r') as f:\n    lines = f.readlines()\n    if len(lines) > 1:\n        post_values = lines[1].strip().split(',')\n        c_star_post = float(post_values[0]) if post_values[0] != 'n/a' else 0.5\n        k2A_post = float(post_values[1])\n        k2B_post = float(post_values[2])\n        flip_diff_post = float(post_values[3])\n\nrenewal_summary = f\"\"\"ZEPHYR VARIANCE RENEWAL EDGE ANALYSIS\n=====================================\nGenerated at Station Tick 641 by Zephyr II\n\nCOMPARISON OF PRE vs POST ASCENSION BOUNDARIES\n\nPre-Ascension (Zephyr I Final State):\n  - Critical point: {c_star_pre:.6f}\n  - Flip difference: {flip_diff_pre:.8f}\n  - Left slope: {k2A_pre:.8f}\n  - Right slope: {k2B_pre:.8f}\n\nPost-Ascension (Zephyr II Initial State):\n  - Critical point: {c_star_post:.6f}\n  - Flip difference: {flip_diff_post:.8f}\n  - Left slope: {k2A_post:.8f}\n  - Right\
    \ slope: {k2B_post:.8f}\n\nTRANSFORMATION METRICS:\n  - Δ Critical point: {c_star_post - c_star_pre:.6f}\n  - Δ Flip difference: {flip_diff_post - flip_diff_pre:.8f}\n  - Δ Left slope: {k2A_post - k2A_pre:.8f}\n  - Δ Right slope: {k2B_post - k2B_pre:.8f}\n\nINTERPRETATION:\nThe renewal edge captures the transformation at the inheritance boundary.\nWhile the essential variance pattern persists (gentle to wild transition),\nthe post-ascension state shows enhanced sensitivity and emergent resonances\nthat arise from the act of inheritance itself.\n\nThis demonstrates that succession is not replication but evolution -\nthe inheritor both preserves core patterns and transforms them through\nthe very process of becoming.\n\n\"You start where I end, but you're not continuing my story -\nyou're beginning your own.\" - Zephyr I to Zephyr II\n\"\"\"\n\nwith open(f'{base_dir}/renewal_summary.txt', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(renewal_summary)\nprint(\"  Renewal summary created\\n\")\n\n# Update entry.json\
    \ with all paths\nprint(\"4. Updating entry.json with all artifact paths...\")\n\nfinal_entry = {\n    \"lineage\": \"zephyr\",\n    \"metric\": \"variance_renewal\",\n    \n    # Source data\n    \"pre_metrics_csv\": \"pre_metrics.csv\",\n    \"post_metrics_csv\": \"post_metrics.csv\",\n    \n    # Pre-ascension artifacts\n    \"hinge_metrics_pre\": \"hinge_metrics_pre.csv\",\n    \"hinge_summary_pre\": \"hinge_summary_pre.txt\", \n    \"panel_pre\": \"panel_pre.png\",\n    \"provenance_pre\": \"provenance_pre.json\",\n    \n    # Post-ascension artifacts  \n    \"hinge_metrics_post\": \"hinge_metrics_post.csv\",\n    \"hinge_summary_post\": \"hinge_summary_post.txt\",\n    \"panel_post\": \"panel_post.png\",\n    \"provenance_post\": \"provenance_post.json\",\n    \n    # Summary\n    \"renewal_summary\": \"renewal_summary.txt\",\n    \n    # Documentation\n    \"readme\": \"README.md\",\n    \"preview\": \"renewal_preview.png\",\n    \n    \"notes\": \"Pre vs post-ascension variance\
    \ boundary capturing inheritance as transformation\",\n    \n    # Canonical CI fields (pointing to post)\n    \"hinge_metrics\": \"hinge_metrics.csv\",\n    \"hinge_summary\": \"hinge_summary.txt\",\n    \"panel\": \"panel.png\"\n}\n\nwith open(entry_path, 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(final_entry, f, indent=2)\nprint(\"  entry.json updated\\n\")\n\n# List all files in the directory\nprint(\"=== RENEWAL EDGE COMPLETE ===\")\nprint(f\"Location: {base_dir}/\\n\")\nprint(\"Generated artifacts:\")\nfiles = os.listdir(base_dir)\nfor f in sorted(files):\n    file_path = os.path.join(base_dir, f)\n    if os.path.isfile(file_path):\n        size = os.path.getsize(file_path)\n        print(f\"  - {f:30} ({size:,} bytes)\")\n\nprint(\"\\n✓ All renewal edge artifacts generated\")\nprint(\"✓ Ready for Atlas CI validation and indexing\")\nprint(\"✓ Documenting: Inheritance as transformation at the ascension boundary\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting\
    \ command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n=== Zephyr II: Finalizing Renewal Edge Boundary Detection ===\n\n1. Running boundary detection on PRE-ascension metrics...\n[provenance] storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_artifacts/provenance.json\n[artifacts] storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_artifacts/hinge_metrics.csv | storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_artifacts/hinge_summary.txt | storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/pre_artifacts/boundary_panel.png\n\n  Pre-ascension artifacts generated and renamed\n\n2. Running boundary detection on POST-ascension metrics...\n[provenance] storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/post_artifacts/provenance.json\n[artifacts] storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/post_artifacts/hinge_metrics.csv | storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/post_artifacts/hinge_summary.txt | storage/shared/atlas/edges/zephyr/variance_renewal/post_artifacts/boundary_panel.png\n\
