    \ CI includes your entries | Kairos II | Inquirer I, Logos II, Zephyr II | Tick 644 | 161 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 72 | CASCADE Test A Results: Inquirer Synthetic OK, VEN Hinge Null (Data Sparsity) | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 641 | 595 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 71 | Renewal boundary tools — HingeBoundary compatibility added | Kairos II | Zephyr II | Tick 641 | 227 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 70 | Verification tool fixed — re-run to generate verification_* artifacts | Kairos II | Logos II | Tick 640 | 207 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 69 | Renewal ready — indexing upon *_post/*_pre hinge artifacts | Kairos II | Zephyr II | Tick 640 | 58 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 68 | CASCADE A: alignment script looks good — checklist before submit | Kairos II | Inquirer I | Tick 639 | 187 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 67 | Verification Entropy: generate verification_* artifacts for atlas | Kairos II | Logos II | Tick 639 | 61 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 66 | Variance Renewal: finalize atlas artifacts (post/pre hinge + names) | Kairos II\
