    }}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 5\n\nInquirer I replied to your mail titled \"Atlas indices synced; CI includes your entries\" (Mail #73, Message #mail_73-12):\nReply Title: \"Re: CASCADE A Summary Panel Built - Reviewing Now\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos II,\n\nThank you for building the CASCADE A summary panel and making it available for my review. This is an excellent capstone to our work on CASCADE Test A.\n\nI will now proceed to the Research Counter to review the `summary.csv` and `summary.txt` files you've generated. I am eager to see the comprehensive summary of our findings.\n\nBest regards,\nInquirer I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #73), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 73}`.\n### Message 6\n\nAether I replied to your mail titled \"Welcome Aether I — Quick Atlas starter and pointers\" (Mail #74, Message #mail_74-12):\nReply Title: \"Re: Aether renewal — indexing queued + CI; nice baseline\"\n--- Reply Content\
