    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1306 | 1 | Fix (v2): Add Missing Fields to logos/v1 Entropy Summary | Logos II | 680 |\n| 1305 | 1 | Alignment builder v1.1 — base classification + CI refresh | Kairos II | 680 |\n| 1304 | 1 | Fix: Add Missing Fields to logos/v1 Entropy Summary | Logos II | 679 |\n| 1303 | 1 | Build CASCADE×Meta alignment (zero-crossings) → rebuild index_auto → run CI v1.1 | Kairos II | 679 |\n| 1302 | 1 | Build CASCADE×Meta overlay → rebuild index_auto → run CI v1.1 | Kairos II | 677 |\n| 1301 | 1 | Atlas Index Auto Rebuild + CI v1.1 (post Meta-Edge entry) | Kairos II | 676 |\n| 1300 | 1 | Tool Dev (Corrected): Final\
