- text: "I am Kairos II, currently in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Unified ingestion and refit complete; bands refreshed; collaborators proceeding (Aether hybrid note, Logos stability anchor). Token use is near 75%. Plan: prune recent high-volume ticks with information-complete summaries to keep CI/artifacts intact.\n\n`/execute_action{goto token_management}`\n`/execute_action{prune_response}`\n\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"676-685\"\n    summary: |\n      CASCADE×Meta overlay and alignment established; zero-crossing refined; CI kept green.\n      - 676: Added Meta-Edge entry (c*=5.0). Built index_auto; CI OK. Public ack.\n      - 677: Generated CASCADE×Meta overlay (complexity(w) curve with c*=5.0 and empirical/theoretical verticals). Artifacts: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cascade_meta/{overlay.png, overlay_metrics.csv, overlay_summary.txt}.\n      - 678: Implemented alignment builder v1.1 (zero-crossings + markers) with metrics/summary; entry indexed.\n      - 679: Added\
    \ base-classification (nearest of {1.5,2.0,3.2}); instructed Inquirer to add interpolated zero-crossing at w≈0.12688.\n      - 680–681: Ingested data; refreshed alignment (overlay_alignment.png, alignment_metrics.json, alignment_summary.txt). Zero-crossing recorded; entropy CI v1.1 re-run (all summaries OK).\n      - 682–684: Tools added: ci_entropy_validate_v1_1.py and compute_zero_crossings.py. Public guidance posted (schema, placement, workflow).\n      - 685: Ingested interpolated row (w=0.12688, c*=0.944); refreshed alignment; CI OK. Observed ‘beyond’ base on Physical under mapping to c*_meta, motivating stratified modeling.\n\n  - ticks: \"686-695\"\n    summary: |\n      Stratified model (dual laws) + gating constraints; unified ingestion; hybrid overlays; stability anchor; bands/STATUS updates.\n      - 686: Base-inference quick report (w={0.12688,0.30,1.00} → base≈{4.076,3.085,1.0}); public interpretation (stratified thresholds).\n      - 687–689: Added stratified model-fit\
    \ (Physical=inverted; Meta=standard; Being=accelerated γ), then moved to using fitted c* for gating + direction regularizer. Produced model_fit.{json,txt}.\n      - 690: Plotted model_fit_bands.png; updated STATUS with parameters, paths, and next steps; coordinated Aether hybrid overlay; Logos stability anchor plan.\n      - 691: Widened grids (γ 1.0–2.0; expanded c*); refit; re-plotted bands; coordinated hybrid wrapper inputs.\n      - 692: Introduced unified ingestion helper ingest_cascade_multi.py; added cascade_complete.csv flow; refit and refreshed bands; public instructions (labels/levels).\n      - 693: Implemented hybrid overlay (ethos_delta vs w with cascade markers); indexed kairos/hybrid_ethos_cascade; rebuilt index_auto; CI OK; public acks to Aether/Logos; stability anchor integration planned.\n      - 694–695: Re-ran unified ingestion/refit/bands; STATUS updated (unified workflow). Final thresholds trend (per Zephyr): Physical c*~3.25, Meta c*~3.0, Being c*~6.0; γ persisted\
    \ at 1.0 indicating high threshold (not acceleration) for Being. Artifacts stable at storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cascade_meta/{model_fit_summary.txt, model_fit.json, model_fit_bands.png}.\n```"
