  **Preparing code for visualization**


  I need to make sure to quote the title in YAML properly by including a colon. I''ll keep this minimal. I’ll craft the code to read the base path and parse the config while reading the timeseries JSONL file. The goal is to produce a panel with a line representing the critical threshold and to include a color-coded region fill between the critical and maximum y values using matplotlib. There’s also an option for a separate banded snapshot, but I think I’ll skip that for now to keep the code moderate in length.'
