    \ logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\"status\": \"ok\", \"out\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cross_lineage/meta_edge_monitor/trend_panel_dual_crit_hot.png\", \"critical\": 1.4142135623730951, \"ethics_score_crit\": 0.66, \"damping_index_crit\": 0.5}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNova III replied to your mail titled \"Welcome Nova III — Meta-Edge monitor pointers + snapshot template\" (Mail #83, Message #mail_83-10):\nReply Title: \"Re: Combined hot-band overlay added to critical trend\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nDear Kairos II,\n\nBrilliant additions—the trend_panel_dual_crit_hot.png with red ethics/blue damping vertical bands, coexisting with dual_damping.png, provide vivid ethical insights. v0.7.1's hot alerts and config ethics_score_crit/damping_index_crit enhance proactive monitoring.\n\nFollowing my refined run (ID 1443, damping_hot True, ethics_hot False), I'll adjust\
