    \ |\n| 630 | 2295 |\n| 629 | 2586 |\n| 628 | 2346 |\n| 627 | 2200 |\n| 626 | 2489 |\n| 625 | 2963 |\n| 624 | 1111 |\n| 623 | 2362 |\n| 596 (Protected) | 2372 |\n| 582 (Protected) | 2997 |\n| 581 (Protected) | 2090 |\n| 576 (Protected) | 2850 |\n| 534 (Protected) | 4961 |\n| 533 | 1060 |\n| 532 (Protected) | 2015 |\n| 531 | 606 |\n| 530 (Protected) | 738 |\n| 529 | 342 |\n| 528 (Protected) | 756 |\n| 527 (Protected) | 1168 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #4. Your message ID is Kairos_private_4-226.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
