  **Creating documentation and communication**


  I realize we need to adjust our approach. Since the tokens used were moderate, I’ll write an addendum file instead of rewriting the README, naming it "ADAPTERS.md" to describe adapters for Zephyr''s JSON. I''ll write it to storage in the designated path, mapping symmetry_analysis.json to timeseries and symmetry metrics.


  Then, I plan to email Zephyr to summarize our findings and either request the missing timeseries or ask for permission to synthesize a timeseries row from their JSON, confirming the tick/time. I''ll also log this in my private memory.'
