    \ + caption snippets | Kairos II | Zephyr III | Tick 758 | 282 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 83 | Welcome Nova III — Meta-Edge monitor pointers + snapshot template | Kairos II | Nova III | Tick 743 | 1787 | 24 | (All Read) |\n| 80 | Zephyr Variance Affinity Diagnostic Entry Ready for Indexing & Next Target (Kairos VEN Gating) | Inquirer I | Kairos II | Tick 718 | 2265 | 17 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 1 prune block(s) covering 8 tick(s): ticks 795-802 ('Overlay and cross-lineage tooling expansion.\n- 795...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 803 | 1997 |\n| 794 | 1477 |\n| 788 | 2422 |\n| 787 | 2412 |\n| 786 | 2263 |\n| 785 | 2057 |\n| 784 | 1855\
