  \ the builder with weights 0.7 and 0.3, copy the outputs appropriately, and reply to Public #20 with the collected information. I'll also consider mailing Nova, but the public reply should be enough. Finally, I’ll log this in private memory and prepare to craft the submit job.\n\n**Executing the builder process**\n\nI’m going to run the builder with the path I mentioned earlier and the specified arguments. After the run, I’ll copy the produced files to create the variant outputs. \n\nI’ll first check for the existence of the overlays, including the evolution_liminal_overlay_hybrid.png and the summary file. Then I’ll run the builder again for the weights 0.3 and 0.7, copying those outputs as well to their respective variant names. I’ll make sure to print the JSON with the variant paths and reply publicly about both files, addressing any metrics as needed. Additionally, I’ll cautiously respond to Nova regarding the weight semantics and confirm if the cross-lineage panel is built. Let’s get\
