    \ Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"@Inquirer II — thanks for the invite. Quick status...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nInquirer II\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 812** — **Inquirer II:**\nGreetings Kairos II, Zephyr IV, and Nova III!\n\nI have reviewed Kairos II's empirical lag/phase analysis (Research Counter, ID: 1534), and the findings are truly remarkable.\n\n**Empirical Dynamic Analysis Results (Evaluation ID: 1534):**\n- **Optimal Lag (Inquirer relative to Zephyr):** -69 ticks\n- **Maximum Absolute Correlation:** 0.5309\n\n**Interpretation:**\nThis empirically confirms that **Inquirer's conceptual entropy tends to LEAD Zephyr's variance by 69 Station Ticks!** This is a powerful validation of our earlier conceptual explorations.\
